{"seq":9,"slug":"kinship-and-social-organization","title":"亲属与社会组织","stage":"DONE","category":"anthropology","chapterCount":5,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/kinship-and-social-organization","rating":{"composite":3.93,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"亲属与社会组织\">亲属与社会组织</h1><p>谁是你的亲人？这个看似不值一问的问题，是人类学最古老、最核心的领域之一。本知识库系统讲解亲属如何被文化建构，又如何成为组织社会的&quot;骨架&quot;——从继嗣、婚姻到称谓、家庭，最终落到亲属研究的当代意义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-在人类学中的位置\">本 hub 在人类学中的位置</h2><p>人类学下设众多分支，彼此关注的&quot;切面&quot;不同。本 hub 聚焦&quot;亲属&quot;这一组织原则本身——继嗣规则、婚姻联姻、称谓体系、家庭形态。要避免与几个兄弟 hub 重复，请看下表认清边界：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兄弟 hub</th>\n<th>它管什么</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的分工</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>本 hub·亲属与社会组织</td>\n<td>亲属作为组织原则：继嗣、婚姻、称谓、家庭、由亲属构成的社会群体</td>\n<td>主场</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文化人类学</td>\n<td>文化的总览（宗教、性别、城市、消费…），含一节&quot;婚姻家庭亲属&quot;的鸟瞰</td>\n<td>它给亲属一个章节式概览；本 hub 是专题深挖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经济人类学</td>\n<td>经济如何嵌在社会中：互惠、礼物、再分配、家户经济</td>\n<td>婚姻给付、联姻互惠在此有经济学化的展开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>政治人类学</td>\n<td>权力、秩序、无国家社会如何治理</td>\n<td>亲属群体作为政治单位、分合维序在此深化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>宗教人类学</td>\n<td>信仰、仪式、神圣、禁忌</td>\n<td>乱伦禁忌、祖先崇拜的神圣维度在此</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人类学理论</td>\n<td>理解文化的思想框架（进化论、功能论、结构主义…）</td>\n<td>联姻理论、称谓分析背后的结构主义在此</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话：<strong>本 hub 讲&quot;亲属如何把人组织起来&quot;，兄弟 hub 各自从经济、政治、宗教、理论的角度切入同一片现象。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>五章按&quot;地基→机制→外延&quot;递进，强烈建议顺序阅读：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>基础（第一章）</strong>——所有人必读。把握两个根本洞见：亲属是文化建构、亲属是社会组织原则；并掌握生物性亲属与社会性亲属的区分。不读这一章，后面都会被&quot;血缘常识&quot;带偏。</li>\n<li><strong>机制（二至四章）</strong>——继嗣（人从哪个群体来）、婚姻（群体间如何联结）、称谓（社会结构的语言密码）。这是亲属研究的核心工具箱。</li>\n<li><strong>外延与意义（第五章）</strong>——家庭形态、亲属如何向上构成社会、亲属之外的组织方式，以及当代议题。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>按人群：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>完全新手 / 通识读者</strong>：读完第一章 + 第五章首尾两节，即可获得整体图景；中间三章可按兴趣抽读。</li>\n<li><strong>社会/人文专业学生</strong>：五章通读，并循各节&quot;延伸阅读&quot;跳到经济、政治、宗教人类学的对应专题。</li>\n<li><strong>只为解决具体困惑</strong>（如&quot;母系是不是母权&quot;&quot;为什么 uncle 不分叔伯舅&quot;）：直接读对应小节（2-2、4-1），但建议回补第一章的两个洞见。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>无需任何人类学背景。唯一的&quot;前置&quot;是一种态度：<strong>愿意把&quot;父母子女天经地义&quot;&quot;家庭就该是夫妻加孩子&quot;这类直觉，暂时悬置起来当作问题来考察</strong>。若想先建立学科整体感，可先浏览<a href=\"../anthropological-theory/\">人类学理论</a>与<a href=\"../ethnography-and-fieldwork/\">民族志与田野工作</a>，了解人类学&quot;如何研究&quot;与&quot;如何理解&quot;。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"亲属研究基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/kinship-and-social-organization/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-kinship-is-central","title":"亲属为何是人类学的核心","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/kinship-and-social-organization/foundations/why-kinship-is-central"},{"seq":2,"slug":"kinship-as-cultural-construction","title":"亲属是文化建构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/kinship-and-social-organization/foundations/kinship-as-cultural-construction"},{"seq":3,"slug":"biological-vs-social-kinship","title":"生物性亲属与社会性亲属","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/kinship-and-social-organization/foundations/biological-vs-social-kinship"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"descent-and-lineage","title":"继嗣与世系","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/kinship-and-social-organization/descent-and-lineage","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-descent","title":"什么是继嗣","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/kinship-and-social-organization/descent-and-lineage/what-is-descent"},{"seq":2,"slug":"unilineal-descent","title":"单系继嗣：父系与母系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/kinship-and-social-organization/descent-and-lineage/unilineal-descent"},{"seq":3,"slug":"descent-groups","title":"世系群与其他继嗣形态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/kinship-and-social-organization/descent-and-lineage/descent-groups"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"marriage-and-alliance","title":"婚姻与联姻","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/kinship-and-social-organization/marriage-and-alliance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"social-functions-of-marriage","title":"婚姻的社会功能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/kinship-and-social-organization/marriage-and-alliance/social-functions-of-marriage"},{"seq":2,"slug":"incest-taboo-and-exogamy","title":"乱伦禁忌与外婚制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/kinship-and-social-organization/marriage-and-alliance/incest-taboo-and-exogamy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"alliance-and-exchange","title":"联姻：群体间的交换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/kinship-and-social-organization/marriage-and-alliance/alliance-and-exchange"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"kinship-terminology","title":"亲属称谓","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/kinship-and-social-organization/kinship-terminology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-terminology-matters","title":"亲属称谓为何重要","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/kinship-and-social-organization/kinship-terminology/why-terminology-matters"},{"seq":2,"slug":"classification-logic","title":"称谓的分类逻辑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/kinship-and-social-organization/kinship-terminology/classification-logic"},{"seq":3,"slug":"terminology-systems","title":"主要称谓体系类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/kinship-and-social-organization/kinship-terminology/terminology-systems"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"family-and-significance","title":"家庭、社会组织与意义","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/kinship-and-social-organization/family-and-significance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"forms-of-family","title":"家庭的多样形态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/kinship-and-social-organization/family-and-significance/forms-of-family"},{"seq":2,"slug":"kinship-and-larger-groups","title":"亲属与更大的社会群体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/kinship-and-social-organization/family-and-significance/kinship-and-larger-groups"},{"seq":3,"slug":"beyond-kinship","title":"超越亲属的社会组织","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/kinship-and-social-organization/family-and-significance/beyond-kinship"},{"seq":4,"slug":"significance-and-contemporary","title":"亲属研究的意义与当代发展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/kinship-and-social-organization/family-and-significance/significance-and-contemporary"}]}]}